{"title":"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/1/891e5529f1bffba2dcbbe0bb88a9350be029f440.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000 + 200 - 10 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"159\" height=\"15\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/c/baccbf4f1f42ed7a51bbc330d61d42f68f17e329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1191 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1190 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1181 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 1209 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 1211$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"487\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/9/1b926133b6c020abf168f99bcfe39f204a5b400b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000 + 200 - 10 + 1 = 1200 - 9 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 1191}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"359\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2015 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a hre